Suppose I have a model with a random effect array, lnepsilon, with dim(n_s,n_t,n_l). The first dimension represents a Gaussian process and the other two represent AR1 processes.
Assuming an interaction between these processes, is it correct to define lnepsilon as:

nll += SEPARABLE( AR1(rho_l), SEPARABLE( AR1(rho_t), GMRF(Q) ) )( lnepsilon )

